-{"id":"orch-a56","title":"fix: monitor STATUS=PROBLEM — is_placeholder_token skipped unresolved plist ${VAR} refs (2026-03-13)","description":"Root cause analysis and fixes for monitor consistently reporting STATUS=PROBLEM.\n\nROOT CAUSE (doctor_sh rc=1):\nGateway plist stores XAI_API_KEY=${XAI_API_KEY} as a literal unresolved template string.\nDoctor.sh plist hydration loop exports this verbatim. resolve_secret_ref() substitutes\n$XAI_API_KEY from env and gets back the literal string \"${XAI_API_KEY}\".\nis_placeholder_token only checked for the specific \"${HERMES_GATEWAY_TOKEN}\" literal,\nso \"${XAI_API_KEY}\" was NOT recognized as a placeholder — xAI probe ran with garbage\ntoken, got HTTP 400, doctor.sh exited rc=1.\n\nFIX (lib/token-probes.sh):\n  if [[ \"$token\" =~ ^\\${[A-Z0-9_]+}$ ]]; then return 0; fi\nAny unresolved ${VAR} plist template reference is now WARN+skip instead of probe+fail.\n\nOTHER FIXES THIS SESSION:\n- sync-hermes-config.sh: removed agents/*/agent/models.json from SYNC_FILES (gateway\n  rewrites them with normalized API key names, causing perpetual sync drift)\n- config.yaml: enabled channels.slack.enabled and plugins.entries.slack.enabled (both false)\n- config.yaml: synced gateway.auth.token to match installed plist token\n- monitor-agent.sh: added MINIMAX_API_KEY plist hydration block\n- Installed plist ~/Library/LaunchAgents: copied template (was missing MINIMAX_API_KEY)\n\nMERGED: PR #126 chore/rehome-repo-to-hermes-dir (~/.hermes/ is now git root, ORCH-d6i)\nARCHIVED: jleechanorg/hermes_config (superseded by rehome)\n\nRESULT: STATUS=GOOD, doctor_sh level=good rc=0, 66 pass 2 warn 0 fail","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"decision","created_at":"2026-03-14T04:00:00Z","created_by":"jleechan","updated_at":"2026-03-14T04:00:00Z","closed_at":"2026-03-14T04:00:00Z","source_repo":".","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["ORCH-d6i","doctor","monitor","token-probes"]}
