-{"id":"orch-cbo.6.2","title":"Event normalizer, dedupe keys, and queue schema","description":"Define and implement event normalization for webhook payloads into a stable remediation queue contract. Include dedupe key generation, stale head-SHA handling, and queue persistence schema for retries and replay.","design":"Normalized key should include repo, PR number, signal type, signal ID, and head SHA. Drop exact duplicate deliveries, suppress stale signals for older head SHAs unless replay-required, and emit canonical queue records with attempt counters and next-attempt timestamps.","acceptance_criteria":"Queue schema and normalizer are implemented with deterministic keying and tests covering duplicate deliveries, stale SHA suppression, and valid event normalization across issue_comment/review/check events.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","owner":"jleechan@example.com","created_at":"2026-03-13T08:11:37Z","created_by":"jleechan","updated_at":"2026-03-13T08:11:37Z","closed_at":"2026-03-13T08:11:37Z","close_reason":"Implemented","source_repo":".","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"orch-cbo.6.2","depends_on_id":"orch-cbo.6","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-03-13T01:11:37Z","created_by":"jleechan","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
